<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #9AA5B1">Hardware and every step: <a href={u("prism/docs/setup/")}>PRISM setup</a> · <a href={u("lens/docs/setup/")}>LENS setup</a> · <a href={u("lumen/docs/setup/")}>LUMEN setup</a></p>
